    "bio": "I design and build custom n8n workflows that cut out repetitive work, connect your favorite tools, and keep things running smoothly\u2014think less busywork, smarter integrations, and faster, error-free results. My goal is to free up your time so you and your team can focus on what really matters. Let\u2019s chat\u2014I\u2019d love to help you turn messy processes into smooth, automated workflows.",
